#: ../../SerialAPI.rst:427
msgid ""
"The `RST` command restarts the CCOS device. This will most likely also "
"break the current Serial connection, and a new connection will need to be"
" made. If the `COMMIT` command has not been called before a `RESTART` "
"command, then the device will revert to the last settings stored in the "
"non-volatile memory."
msgstr ""

